network-monitor (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Add the Security & Threats tab with local heuristics, optional IP and
    file reputation checks, local caching, and confirmed IP blocking.
  * Refresh AppStream metadata, screenshots, translations, and the manual page.
  * Keep using distribution-provided Python, Qt, pyroute2, and NumPy packages.

